Source: oematch
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SymonSays LLC <garrett@symoneural.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, python3-all, python3-setuptools, pybuild-plugin-pyproject
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://symoneural.com
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: oematch
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, binutils, dpkg, git
Recommends: xz-utils, zstd
Description: Match software artifacts to OpenEmbedded/Yocto layers
 Fingerprints a .deb, tarball, wheel, ELF binary or directory using
 package metadata, ELF NEEDED entries, manifests and printable strings,
 then ranks recipes from every layer in the OpenEmbedded Layer Index
 that provide the same libraries, tools and dependencies. Emits a
 bblayers list and DEPENDS stub. No disassembly or decompilation.
